## 👋 About This Repository

This repository is a portfolio of my end-to-end **data science and business analytics projects**, spanning exploratory data analysis, predictive modelling, machine learning, and operations research. Each project includes a dataset, a well-documented Jupyter notebook, and a summary of key findings.

**Sanket C Sakhare** — MSc Business Analytics, University of Birmingham
6+ years of experience in marketing analytics, data science, and business intelligence.

---

## 📂 Projects

### 🗞️ 1. News Virality Predictor — UCI Online News Popularity
> Predicted the number of shares for online news articles using regression, K-means clustering, and CART on a dataset of 40,000+ Mashable articles.

| Detail | Info |
|---|---|
| Dataset | UCI Online News Popularity |
| Techniques | Linear Regression · K-Means Clustering · CART |
| Tools | Python · Scikit-learn · Pandas · Seaborn |
| Outcome | Identified key content features driving viral articles |

---

### ☕ 2. BrewFast Coffee — Operations Analytics
> End-to-end operations analysis for a fictional coffee chain covering demand forecasting, inventory optimisation, and service efficiency modelling.

| Detail | Info |
|---|---|
| Techniques | Time Series Decomposition · Linear Programming · Queuing Theory |
| Tools | Python · SciPy · Statsmodels · Matplotlib |
| Outcome | Identified optimal staffing levels and inventory reorder points |

---

### 📈 3. UPSC Exam Trend Forecaster
> Forecasted 2025 GS Paper I question distribution using probabilistic and time series models, delivered as both a technical and plain-language report.

| Detail | Info |
|---|---|
| Techniques | Dirichlet-Multinomial · ARIMA · Ensemble Methods |
| Tools | Python · Statsmodels · NumPy |
| Outcome | Topic-level probability forecasts for 2025 exam paper |

---

### 🌫️ 4. Delhi Air Pollution — EDA
> Exploratory analysis of Delhi's air quality data uncovering seasonal AQI trends, pollutant correlations, and hazardous pollution periods.

| Detail | Info |
|---|---|
| Dataset | Delhi Airpollution.csv |
| Techniques | EDA · Correlation Analysis · AQI Classification |
| Tools | Python · Pandas · Seaborn · Matplotlib |
| Outcome | Identified winter months as peak hazardous AQI periods |
| Repo | [View Project →](https://github.com/Sujalg1994/Delhi-Pollution-Analysis) |

---

### 📊 5. Marketing Analytics — BioGrove Agroventure
> Delivered a 15% MoM ROI uplift through campaign performance analysis, customer segmentation, and data-driven channel optimisation.

| Detail | Info |
|---|---|
| Techniques | Customer Segmentation · ROI Analysis · A/B Testing |
